sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator<br/>(workstation/CI)
    participant CLI as rhaii-validator CLI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant NS as rhaii-validation<br/>Namespace
    participant Agent as Agent Job Pod<br/>(privileged, per-node)
    participant GPU as GPU Hardware<br/>(host device)
    participant RDMA as RDMA Device<br/>(host NIC)

    Note over Admin,RDMA: Tier 1: Dependency Validation (API-only, no resources created)

    Admin->>CLI: rhaii-validator check deps
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET apiextensions/v1/CRDs<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: CRD list response
    CLI->>CLI: Validate required CRDs<br/>(Gateway API, InferencePool,<br/>LeaderWorkerSet, cert-manager)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET /v1/pods?namespace=istio-system<br/>GET /v1/pods?namespace=cert-manager<br/>GET /v1/pods?namespace=lws-system
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Pod status responses
    CLI->>CLI: Verify operator pod health
    CLI-->>Admin: Tier 1 results (pass/fail/warn)

    Note over Admin,RDMA: Tier 2: Node Validation (creates temporary resources)

    Admin->>CLI: rhaii-validator check all
    CLI->>K8sAPI: POST /v1/namespaces<br/>(create rhaii-validation)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Namespace created
    CLI->>K8sAPI: POST ServiceAccount, ClusterRole,<br/>ClusterRoleBinding (RBAC setup)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: RBAC resources created

    loop For each GPU node
        CLI->>K8sAPI: POST batch/v1/Jobs<br/>(node selector, tolerations,<br/>privileged securityContext)
        K8sAPI->>NS: Schedule agent pod on target node
        NS->>Agent: Pod starts on GPU node

        par GPU Checks
            Agent->>GPU: Query driver version, ECC status,<br/>memory via host devices
            GPU-->>Agent: Hardware metrics
        and RDMA Checks
            Agent->>RDMA: Check device availability,<br/>NIC topology, pingmesh
            RDMA-->>Agent: RDMA connectivity results
        and Network Checks
            Agent->>Agent: iperf3 bandwidth/latency tests<br/>(TCP network performance)
        end

        Agent->>Agent: Write results to stdout
        Agent->>K8sAPI: POST ConfigMap report<br/>(structured results)
        CLI->>K8sAPI: Stream pod logs (real-time)
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Log stream
        CLI->>K8sAPI: GET ConfigMap report
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Structured results
    end

    CLI->>CLI: Aggregate results across nodes
    CLI-->>Admin: Validation report<br/>(pass/warn/fail per check)

    Note over CLI,K8sAPI: Cleanup Phase

    CLI->>K8sAPI: DELETE Jobs, ConfigMaps,<br/>ClusterRoleBindings, ClusterRoles,<br/>ServiceAccount, Namespace
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Resources deleted
    CLI-->>Admin: Cleanup complete
